B.TY=s(["Who we are","Quick PDF Converter is published by Youssef Bouaouam (BY.YOBO), an independent developer based in Morocco, who is responsible for this app. Contact: youssfimalak21@gmail.com"],t.s)
B.a2M=s(["Your files stay on your phone",'The documents you convert are processed only on your device. They are never uploaded to our servers or to any third party. Converted files are saved in the app\'s private storage and you can delete them at any time from "My files"; uninstalling the app deletes them.'],t.s)
B.a_0=s(["Information we collect","We do not ask for an account, a name, an email address or a phone number, and we do not collect any personal data ourselves. Your settings (language, theme) and the list of your converted files are stored only on your phone."],t.s)
B.a_p=s(["Advertising (Google AdMob)","The app is free thanks to ads provided by Google AdMob. To show and measure ads and to prevent fraud, Google may collect: the advertising ID of your device, IP address (approximate location), device and system information, and ad interactions. Google acts as an independent controller of this data. Details: https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"],t.s)
B.a2N=s(["Legal basis (GDPR)","For users in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland: personalised ads and the storing or reading of information on your device are based on your consent (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a) and the ePrivacy Directive). Non-personalised ads, ad measurement and fraud prevention are based on legitimate interests (Art. 6(1)(f)). Consent is collected with Google's consent tool (UMP), certified under the IAB Transparency & Consent Framework."],t.s)
B.a17=s(["Your consent and choices","When you first open the app in these regions, a consent form lets you accept or refuse personalised ads. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time in Settings \u2192 Ad privacy choices. You can also reset or delete your advertising ID in your Android settings. Refusing consent does not prevent you from using the app."],t.s)
B.Wt=s(["Your rights","Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict and port your data, to object to processing, and to withdraw consent at any time. As we do not store your personal data, requests about advertising data are handled by Google (https://myaccount.google.com/data-and-privacy); we will help you if you contact us. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your national data-protection authority."],t.s)
B.VO=s(["International transfers","Google may process advertising data outside your country, including in the United States, using safeguards such as the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses and the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework."],t.s)
B.We=s(["Data retention","We do not keep any of your data on servers. Converted files stay on your phone until you delete them. Data collected by Google is kept according to Google's retention policy."],t.s)
B.Uu=s(["Internet connection","The app needs an internet connection to work (in particular to display ads). Your documents are still never sent over the internet: conversion always happens on your device."],t.s)
B.Vk=s(["Children","The app is not directed to children under 13 (or under 16 where EU national law requires it), and we do not knowingly collect their data. If you believe a child has provided data, contact us and we will help remove it."],t.s)
B.a29=s(["Changes to this policy","We may update this policy. The new version will be published in the app and on our store page, with its date."],t.s)
B.Xc=s(["Contact","For any question or request about your privacy: youssfimalak21@gmail.com"],t.s)
B.YC=s([B.TY,B.a2M,B.a_0,B.a_p,B.a2N,B.a17,B.Wt,B.VO,B.We,B.Uu,B.Vk,B.a29,B.Xc],t.rj)
B.JL=new A.yk("English","Quick PDF Converter","Home","My files","Settings","Convert any document","Fast, free and private \u2014 your files never leave your phone.","100% Free","No sign-up","Private","Conversion tools","Recent files","See all","Your converted files will appear here.","PDF to Word","PDF to Text","PDF to Excel","Word to PDF","Excel to PDF","Editable Word document","Plain text, ready to copy","Tables to a spreadsheet","Share-ready PDF from Word","Sheets & CSV to PDF","Select your file","Tap to choose a file","Supported: {formats}","Change file","Convert now","Converting\u2026","Please keep the app open","Reading the file","Analyzing the content","Creating your document","Pages: {n}","Done! Your file is ready","Open it, share it or save it to your device.","Open","Share","Save to device","Convert another file","File saved successfully",'No app found to open this file. Try "Share" instead.',"Sharing failed. Please try again.","Password protected","This PDF is protected. Enter its password to continue.","Password","Unlock","Wrong password. Please try again.","This PDF is a scanned image: it contains no selectable text to extract.","This file is damaged or not in a supported format.","This file is empty \u2014 there is nothing to convert.","Old .doc / .xls files are not supported. Save the file as .docx / .xlsx and try again.","This file is too large (max 60 MB).","Something went wrong during the conversion. Please try again.","Could not read the selected file.","Please choose a {formats} file.","Conversion failed","Try again","Large file","This is a big document. Watch a short video to unlock its free conversion.","Watch & convert","Not now","My files","No converted files yet","Pick a tool on the home screen to start.","Delete","Delete all","Delete all converted files from this phone?","Cancel","Confirm","This file no longer exists.","Settings","Language","Appearance","System","Light","Dark","Privacy policy","Ad privacy choices","Rate the app","Share the app","I convert PDF, Word and Excel files for free with this app \ud83d\udc49 {link}","Contact us","Version","Made with \u2764 by","Every format, one app","PDF to Word or Excel \u2014 and Word or Excel back to PDF.","Private by design","Conversions happen on your phone. Nothing is uploaded, no account needed.","Free and unlimited","Convert as many files as you want \u2014 fast, easy and free.","Next","Skip","Get started","Today","Yesterday","Your privacy matters to us",B.YC,"Last updated: October 2026","No internet connection","Quick PDF Converter needs an internet connection. Turn on Wi-Fi or mobile data, then try again.","By continuing, you accept our Privacy Policy.")
B.Xa=s(["Qui sommes-nous","Convertisseur PDF Rapide est publi\xe9 par Youssef Bouaouam (BY.YOBO), d\xe9veloppeur ind\xe9pendant bas\xe9 au Maroc, responsable de cette application. Contact : youssfimalak21@gmail.com"],t.s)
B.a2e=s(["Vos fichiers restent sur votre t\xe9l\xe9phone","Les documents que vous convertissez sont trait\xe9s uniquement sur votre appareil. Ils ne sont jamais envoy\xe9s sur nos serveurs ni \xe0 un tiers. Les fichiers convertis sont enregistr\xe9s dans l'espace priv\xe9 de l'application ; vous pouvez les supprimer \xe0 tout moment depuis \xab Mes fichiers \xbb, et la d\xe9sinstallation les efface."],t.s)
B.a3L=s(["Donn\xe9es collect\xe9es","Nous ne demandons ni compte, ni nom, ni e-mail, ni num\xe9ro de t\xe9l\xe9phone, et nous ne collectons nous-m\xeames aucune donn\xe9e personnelle. Vos r\xe9glages (langue, th\xe8me) et la liste de vos fichiers convertis restent uniquement sur votre t\xe9l\xe9phone."],t.s)
B.a1T=s(["Publicit\xe9 (Google AdMob)","L'application est gratuite gr\xe2ce aux annonces de Google AdMob. Pour afficher et mesurer les annonces et pr\xe9venir la fraude, Google peut collecter : l'identifiant publicitaire de votre appareil, l'adresse IP (localisation approximative), des informations sur l'appareil et le syst\xe8me, et vos interactions avec les annonces. Google agit en tant que responsable de traitement ind\xe9pendant. D\xe9tails : https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"],t.s)
B.ZZ=s(["Base l\xe9gale (RGPD)","Pour les utilisateurs de l'Espace \xe9conomique europ\xe9en, du Royaume-Uni et de la Suisse : les annonces personnalis\xe9es et le stockage ou la lecture d'informations sur votre appareil reposent sur votre consentement (art. 6(1)(a) du RGPD et directive ePrivacy). Les annonces non personnalis\xe9es, la mesure et la pr\xe9vention de la fraude reposent sur l'int\xe9r\xeat l\xe9gitime (art. 6(1)(f)). Le consentement est recueilli via l'outil de Google (UMP), certifi\xe9 dans le cadre IAB Transparency & Consent Framework."],t.s)
B.a1F=s(["Votre consentement et vos choix","\xc0 la premi\xe8re ouverture dans ces r\xe9gions, un formulaire vous permet d'accepter ou de refuser les annonces personnalis\xe9es. Vous pouvez modifier ou retirer votre consentement \xe0 tout moment dans R\xe9glages \u2192 Choix de confidentialit\xe9 des annonces, et r\xe9initialiser ou supprimer votre identifiant publicitaire dans les r\xe9glages Android. Refuser ne vous emp\xeache pas d'utiliser l'application."],t.s)
B.W5=s(["Vos droits","Le RGPD vous donne le droit d'acc\xe8s, de rectification, d'effacement, de limitation et de portabilit\xe9, le droit d'opposition et le droit de retirer votre consentement \xe0 tout moment. Comme nous ne stockons pas vos donn\xe9es personnelles, les demandes relatives aux donn\xe9es publicitaires sont trait\xe9es par Google (https://myaccount.google.com/data-and-privacy) ; nous vous aiderons si vous nous contactez. Vous pouvez aussi introduire une r\xe9clamation aupr\xe8s de votre autorit\xe9 de protection des donn\xe9es (en France : la CNIL)."],t.s)
B.Xb=s(["Transferts internationaux","Google peut traiter les donn\xe9es publicitaires hors de votre pays, notamment aux \xc9tats-Unis, avec des garanties comme les clauses contractuelles types de la Commission europ\xe9enne et le Data Privacy Framework UE\u2013\xc9tats-Unis."],t.s)
B.Vu=s(["Dur\xe9e de conservation","Nous ne conservons aucune de vos donn\xe9es sur des serveurs. Les fichiers convertis restent sur votre t\xe9l\xe9phone jusqu'\xe0 leur suppression. Les donn\xe9es collect\xe9es par Google sont conserv\xe9es selon la politique de Google."],t.s)
B.Ur=s(["Connexion Internet","L'application n\xe9cessite une connexion Internet pour fonctionner (notamment pour afficher les annonces). Vos documents ne sont pourtant jamais envoy\xe9s sur Internet : la conversion se fait toujours sur votre appareil."],t.s)
B.a_j=s(["Enfants","L'application ne s'adresse pas aux enfants de moins de 13 ans (ou 16 ans lorsque le droit national de l'UE l'exige) et nous ne collectons pas sciemment leurs donn\xe9es. Si vous pensez qu'un enfant a fourni des donn\xe9es, contactez-nous."],t.s)
B.a2c=s(["Modifications","Cette politique peut \xeatre mise \xe0 jour. La nouvelle version sera publi\xe9e, avec sa date, dans l'application et sur la fiche du store."],t.s)
B.Uj=s(["Contact","Pour toute question ou demande concernant vos donn\xe9es : youssfimalak21@gmail.com"],t.s)
